mpiles "},{"type":"text","text":"hot","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]},{"type":"text","text":" methods (called often, loops) from bytecode to optimised native machine code, with tricks like inlining and escape analysis. That''s why Java programs “warm up”."}]}]}},"revision":1}]'::jsonb, '019a118c-f480-7000-8000-000000000001', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-07 03:23:53+00'
